WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.578
A Tenin Coulibaly. Yʋʋmd 1915 kɩɩsgã kibar sẽn yɩll n sõng-d tɩ d bãnge.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.426
Yʋʋmd 1915. A Mohoun pʋga pʋgẽ, bug-tẽng a ye n be t'a vɩ ne pʋʋgo.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.624
A Tenin ne a sɩdã tara biiga.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.930
La tẽn-kãng yaa soolmã taoor soaba. Zĩ-kãnga taoor soab wa n waa tẽn-kãng pʋgẽ.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.900
M segd n dɩka koodã la nin-buiidã sorã yĩnga.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.400
Tõnd gãos-n-soadbã kolgame tɩ b ka tar bũmb ye.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.716
Woto pa sokr ye, yaa noor la b kõ-yã.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.424
Gũusg-n-taas rɩka koabgã n tall neb a tãabo.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.861
Sẽn na yɩl n tõog-b tɩ b bãng b sẽn tõe n maan to-to wã, yaa tɩlae tɩ b tʋm tʋʋmde.

00:01:13.861 --> 00:01:16.927
Kẽng-y tao-tao. Bɩ y kẽng taoor!

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.920
Rao a ye wãbdame, t'a zĩndi.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.394
Kẽng-y y yĩngri. Yaa tʋʋmde!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.026
D segd n baooda neb wʋsg n paase. Rẽ n so t'a gũudbã lebg n wa tẽngã pʋgẽ.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.512
Wakat kãnga, b pʋd-a lame t'a Tenin sẽn tar pʋgã.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.624
A tara tõnd biiga!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.032
La d na n talla-a lame.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.704
Tʋm-tʋmdã pʋgẽ, b tʋt-a lame t'a lʋɩ.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.960
Bas-y-yã-a!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.930
Ned n dat n sõng-a lame. La gũudã gɩdg-a lame t'a pa maan woto ye.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.104
Zĩ-kãng yʋngo, tẽngã nebã ra tigma taab n gũbg bugmã.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.334
Bas-y tɩ b maan woto! D pa na n le kõ bũmb ye.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:49.314
Kãsem-dãmbã sakame. B sẽn da wa n wẽed bugumã, b tʋmda koe-moondbã tɩ b kẽng tẽns a taabã.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.106
Yʋʋmd 1915 noobre. A Bani-Volta zabrã sɩngame.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.842
Rẽ n so t'a Zeova nin-buiidã na n paama sũ-noogo. Sagl-kãens leokda zab-teedã.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:31.208
Ned ning sẽn tigimd tãnsã zãad-a lame, la gũudbã zoeeme.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.856
A Tenin basame.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:04:01.146
B sẽn wa n maand woto wã kɩtame tɩ b tõog n moond koɛɛgã tẽns wʋsg pʋsẽ. A na n yɩɩ nin-tũusds nins sẽn be Afirik Wɛtgã wakatẽ wã sʋka.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:15.026
La yʋʋmd 1916 wã, sodaasã kɩtame tɩ kɩɩsgã sa. Tẽnsã sã n paam raoodã, b segd n baoo ligd wʋsgo.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.400
Pag ne bi-ribl, tẽn-tẽng sẽn yeel tɩ ka be ye.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.524
Yaa rẽ yĩng la d tẽegd bũmb nins d sẽn maandã.
